| Delivery Staff | suresh@laundryfriends.test / 9000000004 OR anita@laundryfriends.test / 9000000006 | delivery@123 | Delivery tasks, collect/change payment with note |
| Customer | anita.sharma@example.com / 9812345670 | customer123 | Customer dashboard |

## Task 1: Service Rate Management
- **Requirement**: Rate of services should be fixed by owner/admin only. Pickup boy can add extra charges with notes and amount for both kg-wise and piece-wise.
- **Implementation**: 
  - Service rates should be editable only by admin/owner
  - Pickup boy should have an option to add extra charges with notes
  - For kg-wise services, when selecting "mix laundry kg wise", all items should be added separately
  - For kg-wise services, pickup boy should be able to verify the weight

## Task 2: Due Amount Modification
- **Requirement**: Due amount cannot be modified by pickup and delivery boy
- **Implementation**: 
  - Only admin/owner should be able to modify due amounts
  - Pickup and delivery boys should only view due amounts

## Task 3: Service Rate Modification
- **Requirement**: Rate of services cannot be changed by customer, pickup boy, or delivery boy. Should be fixed as menu.
- **Implementation**: 
  - Service rates should be read-only for all except admin/owner
  - Create a fixed service menu that all users can view but not modify

## Task 4: Order Addition Confirmation
- **Requirement**: When clicked on "add to order", show a popup message with service name
- **Implementation**: 
  - Add a confirmation popup when items are added to an order
  - Display the service name in the confirmation message

## Task 5: Verification UI/UX
- **Requirement**: Good UI message for twice verification
- **Implementation**: 
  - Create a clear UI for verification process
  - Add clear messages for each verification step

## Task 6: Item Addition UI/UX
- **Requirement**: UI/UX and logic for adding items should be improved. Provide article name to select then service or vice versa for customer, admin, pickup boy.
- **Implementation**: 
  - Improve the item addition flow
  - Allow selection of article name first, then service
  - Or allow selection of service first, then article name
  - Make the flow intuitive for all user types

## Task 7: Order Modification by Pickup Boy
- **Requirement**: If customer created order but pickup boy has to change whole order for the customer, allow it. Customer may not understand the ordering process via service.
- **Implementation**: 
  - Allow pickup boys to modify entire orders created by customers
  - Provide clear indication when an order is being modified

## Task 8: Service and Article Management Flow
- **Requirement**: Make services and article management flow better for user and all user experience
- **Implementation**: 
  - Improve the workflow for managing services and articles
  - Make it intuitive for all user types
  - Streamline the management process
